{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隔天。", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "得到萬智老師的協助，我們班召開了臨時班會。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為如此，現在的學園長正在為了實現明年的正式合併而奮鬥……！」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3153", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理跟我與萬智老師商量後，提出的議題便是……「學校合併」。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們對班上的同學說明了學園長的現狀。", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……對不起，本來應該要保密的。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～雖然是那樣啦。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mc0177", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是沒關係，我也豁出去了。為了學生，不管開除還是減俸都沒什麼好怕的。」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mc0178", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「各位，到這邊都瞭解了嗎？」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mc0179", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瞭、瞭解了……」", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 408, "voice": "ja0047", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sb0035", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，這種情況下，我們學生也幫不上什麼忙……」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但還是想做點什麼不是嗎！」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3154", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理認真的眼神環視班上的同學。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為……希望能夠正式合併嘛！」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3155", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室內靜了下來。", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家互相看著彼此。", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以？」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0036", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，所以，我想收集大家的連署！！今天就是為了這個目的而召開臨時班會。」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3156", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這就是愛理跟我跟萬智老師想到的，「自己可以做到的事」。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「到頭來，我們學生除了把全部的事都交給學園長以外什麼都做不到。」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3157", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是，正因為如此，我們才想要收集連署。表達有這麼多學生都在期待學校合併。」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3158", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「把我們的心意傳達給那個人……希望那個人能繼續努力！！」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3159", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "da0031", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "jb0024", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3160", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理的表情有點驚訝。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也不知該如何是好。", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……同學們的反應，比我們預想得更冷淡。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這樣……什麼啦？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3161", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家不希望合併順利嗎？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3162", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……瀨名同學妳怎麼說那種話？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "jb0025", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3163", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瀨名同學不是最反對的嗎……」", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0037", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對我們來說怎麼樣都無所謂……但是，妳的態度完全１８０度轉變……」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 408, "voice": "ja0048", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那……那是、這樣沒錯……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3164", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且啊，瀨名同學，其實妳只是不想跟瓜生分開而已吧？」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "sa0031", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什……！？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3165", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下，為什麼要提這個？」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好啦好啦男朋友跳出來說話了。」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sb0036", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「平常就是那樣親親熱熱呢……因為自己很幸福，對吧？」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0038", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為交了男朋友，成績一落千丈……不覺得很丟臉嗎？」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "jb0026", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那那、那是因為身體不舒服……考試結束後瀨名同學不是請假了嗎？老師接到電話了喔！」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mc0180", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是做了什麼才感冒的？」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0039", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那樣的人提出這種提案，只會讓人覺得公私不分～」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 408, "voice": "ja0049", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔唔……」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3166", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "從前明明那麼有人望的愛理──", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "現在在大家眼中卻是這種形象。", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我說了！我只是想向學園長表達，為了正式合併希望她努力加油而已！！」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3167", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「這是轉移話題呢。」", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "結女學生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 409, "voice": "jb0027", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說得真好聽，一副自己最正確的樣子。」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0040", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～～～～」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3168", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "比起對議題的意見，更多的是對愛理本人的排斥──", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管說什麼都沒有用。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室內的氣氛每一秒都在惡化。", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那個，請等一下。這種時候不該針對個人攻擊吧！」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不得不站出來講話。", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是。", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……結果瓜生也是那樣？」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "da0032", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「合併試辦開始之後，你就積極想融入這邊，感覺很奇怪欸。」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": "db0022", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結果，只是想追到瀨名同學而已吧？讓人有這種感覺呢。」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sb0037", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 359, "voice": "sc0029", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以啊……不贊成欸。」", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "da0033", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家的排斥不只針對愛理，連我也受到攻擊。", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "至今為止明明很順利的，現在卻完全無法溝通。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "万智", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「等、等一下，總之大家先安靜下來……冷靜一點聽他們說，好嗎？好嗎？」", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "萬智", "alt_speaker_idx": 416, "voice": "mc0181", "char_id": "万智"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3169", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理無助地看向我。", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『怎麼辦……！？』", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『這個情況……』", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不用開口也明白。", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室中充滿同學們反對的視線和話語，我跟愛理幾乎無法繼續站在講台上。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔──」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──好難受。", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "氣氛超級糟糕。", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這都是……我們的錯。", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果是以前的我們。", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我重新體認到。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為自己導致場面的氣氛變糟，以前的我們大概不是忍耐就是離開……", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾……」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3170", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「──唔！」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "身旁的愛理想握住我的手，她的反應讓我做出了行動。", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我深呼吸一口氣。", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「我邂逅了！！！」", "text_idx": 6, "plain": "「我邂逅了！！！」", "plain_idx": 307, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "教室內頓時安靜了下來。", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「學園長說過的，所謂的『另一半』！！」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在讓人不安的沉默中──我豁出去了。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為在我眼裡愛理比任何人都耀眼，我被她吸引了。」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、啊、欸……」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3171", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想大家都知道，愛理她比任何人都還要努力……」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在冒冷汗。身體和腦袋卻發熱。", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我不會停下來。", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因為這是我真實的想法。", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在我們來這裡之後，大家也感覺到愛理漸漸改變了吧？」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「原本難親近的她，現在變成大家能毫不客氣地向她抱怨……」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家都知道，愛理其實是個有點傻傻的，讓人無法放著不管的女孩子對吧！？」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新、新、吾。」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3172", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是個男人，遇到這樣的女孩子，當然就喜歡上了！」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那個、新吾、那個、已經……」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3173", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不想要讓這份心意變成一種愧疚──", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因為愛理在這所結女成為了『好女人』，所以我才喜歡上她了！！」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在講台上、在大家面前大聲地說。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……超級刺眼的放閃。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那個、我、我、啊唔……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3174", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理滿臉通紅。", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我大概比她更紅。", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉，愛理。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋……！」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3175", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，安靜的同學們突然──", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "汎用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "%123;「閃死了～～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 7, "plain": "「閃死了～～～～～！！」", "plain_idx": 340, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "全班同學", "alt_speaker_idx": 353, "voice": "go056", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看著臉紅的我們放聲大笑。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸、欸？」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3176", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的～熱戀中的情侶呢～！」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0041", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下來應該是瀨名抱住瓜生然後接吻的劇情吧～」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "sa0033", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸欸欸欸欸！？」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3177", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「她說『笨蛋』耶！唔唔～好想被人這樣罵喔～～！！」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "da0035", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "結女生徒Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊哈哈，但是該說的不是那句吧？是『我也喜歡你瓜生！』才對呀～！」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "結女學生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 408, "voice": "ja0050", "char_id": "結女生徒Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "各務台男子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生，你太遜了！唔哈哈哈，快點下台啦！」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 363, "voice": "db0024", "char_id": "各務台男子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「快啊快啊瀨名同學，接吻、接吻、接吻！」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0042", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那……那種事……怎麼可能在大家面前做嘛！」", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3178", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "各務台女子Ｂ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「慌張了慌張了，啊哈哈、啊哈哈哈，真的是閃死了～～！」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生B", "alt_speaker_idx": 358, "voice": "sb0039", "char_id": "各務台女子Ｂ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呃、呃那個……」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔～～～～」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3179", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎麼回事──", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家笑著起鬨、挖苦我們，我們已經慌到手足無措了。", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結……結果是怎麼樣啦大家！！希望合併還是不希望啊……！？」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3180", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "愛理幾乎是哀號地大喊。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「贊成～我也想要這樣的邂逅啊！」", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 421, "voice": "ht0251", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊贊成贊成，安潔也是！」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 371, "voice": "ag0592", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太和安潔舉起了手。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然我有美羽學姊了無所謂……不過對你們來說是生死危機啊～」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 407, "voice": "sn0205", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "乾同學的一句話似乎說出了大家的心聲──", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "各務台女子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔……」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "各務台女生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 357, "voice": "sa0034", "char_id": "各務台女子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "結女生徒Ｃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我……我也是！我也想要邂逅！」", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "結女學生C", "alt_speaker_idx": 410, "voice": "jc0043", "char_id": "結女生徒Ｃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": "各務台男子Ａ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也是我也是！只有瓜生遇到好事真的不能忍～！難得的和結女學生一起生活的機會，千萬不要結束啊！」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "各務台男生A", "alt_speaker_idx": 362, "voice": "da0036", "char_id": "各務台男子Ａ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也是、我也是……同學們紛紛表態。", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也有想像瀨名同學一樣找到另一半、只有女生的學校沒辦法這樣……之類的意見。", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那、那個，所以，那麼……？」", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3181", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是說……」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "結女學生們", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "go057", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": "汎用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女子學校太無趣了！」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "結女學生們", "alt_speaker_idx": 411, "voice": "go058", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 375, "voice": "ar3182", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……哈哈……！」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 398, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──原來是這樣。", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看著率先成為情侶關係的我和愛理，大家只是稍微有點忌妒而已……的樣子。", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟愛理互看了一眼。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「謝謝你……！」「謝謝妳……！」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理／新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 382, "voice": "ar3183", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route02_11.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們同時道謝，結果又被大家糗了一番。", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
